  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Elgon Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Coffee .Beneficiaries: 50040 Smallholder farmers, of whom 18040 are women..USADF funds will be used to increase farmers access to production inputs, promoting wide adoption of good agricultural practices (GAPs), and improving post-harvest handling of produce. Funds will also be used to enhance bulking, value addition, increasing farmer access to profitable markets as well as building the cooperatives technical and management capacity..</narrative>
  </description>
